      "writtenOn": "2021-09-01T22:40:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Alternatives off the top of my head:\n\u003e 1. Giving the AP control over it. Presumably, this will be the endgame when mode support on the AP is fully developed. IIRC, the AP folks did not want control over this. (Prashant, is that accurate?)\n\nThat is correct. We *currently* don\u0027t want to control this, since there is no way for the AP to sequence the rest of the mode entry flow. We *will* want this once mode entry VDM messaging from the kernel is implemented, but that\u0027s still in the planning phase.",
      "parentUuid": "0789eebe_77fba2be",
