        "id": 1287197
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-09-16T21:24:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We can keep this in the PE for now.  I think the spec assumes to some degree that the DPM is the one in charge of turning on/off Vconn and setting the muxes and such, which I assume is why it says the DPM should complete these steps.",
      "parentUuid": "565862ca_d9957609",
      "revId": "27afb0a54303da5a475550816f09bb7750b89add",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
