      "writtenOn": "2021-09-01T04:32:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do you also feel vaguely confused how to reconcile the order of steps in 6.3.14 with the fact that the UFP already turned off Vconn in the last state?  If so, I can send an e-mail to the WG or check with Benson",
      "revId": "27afb0a54303da5a475550816f09bb7750b89add",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
