        "id": 1305927
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-09-10T22:24:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think I just used this as a quick way to see whether the message had completed. SenderResponseTimer doesn\u0027t apply here.",
      "parentUuid": "c5542ebf_58498de7",
      "revId": "27afb0a54303da5a475550816f09bb7750b89add",
